      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "text": "Day 2 · Sugarloaf Mountain & Rio City Tour. After breakfast, your English-speaking guide meets you in the hotel lobby for a 4-hour excursion. From Praia Vermelha (Red Beach), the cable car takes you to Urca Hill, whose spacious observation deck, restaurants and bars offer spectacular views across Rio, then on to Sugar Loaf, with panoramas over Copacabana, Ipanema and Leblon, Guanabara Bay, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and Niterói, the surrounding mountains and islands, and Christ the Redeemer on Corcovado. The tour continues by car to the historic centre, with its old churches, monasteries and colonial architecture and, time permitting, the São Sebastião Cathedral and the colourful Selarón Steps.",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d3f1f6888dcc3a5f5fdf324394179d4fa4668f1bfe5b8a0f7b2489ffaaae6def",
